      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KOORINGA KATE (3) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from six starts. Below best last time at this track (23.86) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 6 length fifth. Rates a leading player. FEDERAL ESCAPE (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (17.42) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including four wins. Expected to give a good account. ORSON ROCKET (6) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (17.08) at this track behind Royal Carol in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from four starts. Expected to feature. SIMULTANEOUSLY (2) is another with top-three prospects.",
